NOTE ON THE MODEL

This project is MIT licensed. The Gemma model it optionally loads is NOT covered
by that licence and is not redistributed here. `google/gemma-3-4b-it` and
`google/gemma-3-1b-it` are published by Google under the Gemma Terms of Use, and
are gated on HuggingFace: you must accept Google's licence yourself and
authenticate to download them. See https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms.

With no model weights present, this program still runs -- it falls back to the
deterministic generator shipped in `backend/app/ai/fallback.py`.
